      "title": "President Murmu gives assent to Bill to rename Kerala as Keralam",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/president-murmu-gives-assent-to-bill-to-rename-kerala-as-keralam/article71355712.ece",
      "description": "The Lok Sabha passed the Kerala (Alteration of Name) Bill, 2026, on August 11, 2026, followed by the Rajya Sabha the next day",
